  "Descargar el paquete": ["Baixa el paquet", "Download the pack"],
  "Cerrado, nadie puede crear, cambiar ni borrar sus facturas y gastos de este trimestre (sí cobrarlos, pagarlos o añadir justificantes).": ["Un cop tancat, ningú no pot crear, canviar ni esborrar les seves factures i despeses d'aquest trimestre (sí cobrar-les, pagar-les o afegir justificants).", "Once closed, nobody can create, change or delete this quarter's invoices and expenses (collecting, paying or adding supporting documents is still fine)."],
